{"parentUuid":"41a4c8b7-e6a6-4529-bdd4-8768b8ebeec8","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6cefca1489dff952","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01MjpMRuLYbXqG9HuFu1BPmq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013QonR4GUSs3NKqoVzg4Uef","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -c \"\nimport json, sys\npath = r'D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\docs\\research\\agent_transcripts\\a37cf00dce550f097.output'\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        try:\n            obj = json.loads(line)\n        except: continue\n        msg = obj.get('message',{})\n        for c in msg.get('content',[]):\n            if c.get('type')=='text' and ('DFF' in c.get('text','') or 'Fekete' in c.get('text','') or 'Dual Feasible' in c.get('text','') or '面积下界' in c.get('text','')):\n                print('---')\n                print(c['text'])\n\" 2>&1 | head -200","description":"Extract DFF-related text via Python JSON parsing"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_read_input_tokens":34044,"output_tokens":338,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":338,"cache_read_input_tokens":34044,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":175,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CapB3zxiPYvmgCDwX82Tz","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"330b0749-eb06-4860-a3ed-4dc57481cc75","timestamp":"2026-05-08T00:42:53.517Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"330b0749-eb06-4860-a3ed-4dc57481cc75","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c7db7605-6412-4f91-9ee8-f6c1e53b7f54","agentId":"a6cefca1489dff952","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013QonR4GUSs3NKqoVzg4Uef","type":"tool_result","content":"Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"<string>\", line 11, in <module>\r\n    if c.get('type')=='text' and ('DFF' in c.get('text','') or 'Fekete' in c.get('text','') or 'Dual Feasible' in c.get('text','') or '面积下界' in c.get('text','')):\r\n       ^^^^^\r\nAttributeError: 'str' object has no attribute 'get'","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4b7c9a2e-6519-4aeb-bd85-998c3457fbbe","timestamp":"2026-05-08T00:42:53.700Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"330b0749-eb06-4860-a3ed-4dc57481cc75","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4b7c9a2e-6519-4aeb-bd85-998c3457fbbe","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6cefca1489dff952","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Ucd84kfUQLLiaeQyNrUZb9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014G3QDg2PYpHcERiNQZYDMj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -c \"\nimport json\npath = r'D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\docs\\research\\agent_transcripts\\a37cf00dce550f097.output'\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for i,line in enumerate(f):\n        try:\n            obj = json.loads(line)\n        except: continue\n        msg = obj.get('message',{})\n        content = msg.get('content',[])\n        if isinstance(content, str):\n            t = content\n        else:\n            t = ''\n            for c in content:\n                if isinstance(c,dict) and c.get('type')=='text':\n                    t += c.get('text','')\n        if t and ('DFF' in t or 'Fekete' in t or 'Dual Feasible' in t):\n            print(f'=== line {i} ===')\n            print(t[:6000])\n\"  2>&1 | head -300","description":"Extract DFF text properly handling mixed content types"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":34219,"output_tokens":376,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":485},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":376,"cache_read_input_tokens":34219,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":485,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CapB4QxbUSznRmPZegXyk","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"5bf5c337-00f3-4101-b155-87c4ce766144","timestamp":"2026-05-08T00:42:59.608Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"5bf5c337-00f3-4101-b155-87c4ce766144","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c7db7605-6412-4f91-9ee8-f6c1e53b7f54","agentId":"a6cefca1489dff952","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014G3QDg2PYpHcERiNQZYDMj","type":"tool_result","content":"=== line 51 ===\r\nGood — confirms the project already has a sophisticated precheck framework (group packing, signature monotonic, same-x strip capacity, ghost overlap, etc.). The recommendations should focus on what's NOT yet there. Final report below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 70x70 + 266 设施场景下还能加的 Precheck 调研\r\n\r\n## 现有 precheck 已覆盖（先盘点）\r\n项目里已有：boundary_port_feasibility、group_packing、signature_monotonic、same_x_strip_capacity、ghost_overlap、coordinate_validation、anchor119_guarded、mandatory_rectangle_profiler、coordinate_group。下面只列**还没做的**。\r\n\r\n## 12 个具体可加 Precheck\r\n\r\n### 1. 面积下界 + DFF 收紧（Dual Feasible Functions）\r\n对 ghost rect 内部\"剩余可用面积\"做检查：266 设施总面积 ≥ ghost 之外的剩余面积？再用 Fekete-Schepers 的 u(α) DFF 把每个设施\"放大\"，看放大后总面积是否仍 ≤ ghost 外可用面积。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：5-10% 候选（中型 ghost 如 70×30、70×35 的窄长候选最容易被卡）\r\n- **工程量**：1-2 天，纯算术，无 CP-SAT 调用\r\n- **依据**：Carlier-Clautiaux-Moukrim 2007，Fekete-Schepers 2004\r\n\r\n### 2. Conservative Scales (CS) 多维收紧\r\nDFF 的二维推广。两个方向各跑一次 DFF，乘出\"等效面积\"。比单向 DFF 紧得多。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：再 +3-5%（DFF 抓不到、但 CS 抓得到的那一档）\r\n- **工程量**：2-3 天\r\n- **依据**：Belov-Kartak-Rohling-Scheithauer 2013 OR Spectrum\r\n\r\n### 3. Energetic Reasoning（一维投影）\r\n把 ghost 的每个 x 切片当成\"时间窗\"，每个设施对该切片的\"能量贡献\"算出来，看是否超过切片高度。这是 cumulative scheduling 的经典剪枝，ortools 的 `use_energetic_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d` 内部用，但**在 outer loop 提前一层跑**就能不进 CP-SAT 直接秒杀。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：3-7%（特别是窄 ghost，70×11/12/19 这类已被 boundary 秒杀的，能再扩一档把 70×13/14 也秒）\r\n- **工程量**：2-4 天，需要写一维 sweep\r\n- **依据**：Baptiste-Le Pape-Nuijten 2001；arXiv 1310.5564 Ouellet-Quimper checker\r\n\r\n### 4. Conflict Graph + Clique Cover 不可同放\r\n对 266 设施两两计算\"是否能共存于该 ghost\"（基于 boundary port 冲突、流量冲突、电力冲突）。建冲突图后求最大团；如果某个团 size > ghost 能容下的最大独立 group 数，infeasible。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：2-5%（覆盖 boundary precheck 漏掉的\"两两都能放但三个不能共存\"场景）\r\n- **工程量**：3-5 天\r\n- **依据**：Zahrouni-Kamoun 2025 bin packing with conflicts\r\n\r\n### 5. Multi-Commodity Flow LP 松弛容量检查\r\n把电力/物流网络抽象成最大流问题（不需要确定 routing，只检查容量），跑一次 LP relaxation。如果 LP 都不可行，CP-SAT 必定不可行。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：5-10%（特别是细长 ghost，电力/物流走廊不够）\r\n- **工程量**：4-7 天，可以用 ortools.linear_solver\r\n- **依据**：Cordeau et al. 多商品 facility location；Lagrangean 分解传统\r\n\r\n### 6. Bin Completion / Pattern Enumeration 行扫描\r\n按行/列把 ghost 切成 strip，每条 strip 枚举\"哪些 group 能塞进去\"作为 1D bin。如果某 strip 不存在合法 packing，infeasible。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：3-6%\r\n- **工程量**：3-4 天\r\n- **依据**：Korf 2002 bin completion；Christofides-Whitlock 1977 corner-points\r\n\r\n### 7. Klee Measure 剩余面积 + skyline 检查\r\n用 Klee Measure（O(n log n) 算 n 个矩形并集面积）算出 mandatory group 占用的\"硬下界面积\"，对剩余区域跑 skyline，看能否塞进剩下的非强制设施。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：2-4%\r\n- **工程量**：2-3 天，sweep line 实现成熟\r\n- **依据**：Bentley 1977，Chan 2013 \"Klee Made Easy\"\r\n\r\n### 8. CP-SAT presolve 参数批量开\r\n不是新写代码，是改参数：\r\n- `cp_model_probing_level=3`（默认 2）\r\n- `presolve_substitution_level` 调高\r\n- `symmetry_level=2` 配合 grouped encoding\r\n- `use_strong_propagation_in_disjunctive=True`\r\n- `presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit=60`（默认 30）\r\n\r\n让 CP-SAT presolve 阶段秒杀更多。注意：probing_level=3 在大模型上有时慢，要 A/B 测。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：3-8%（presolve 杀掉的等同于\"0 attempts\" 但日志会归到 presolve）\r\n- **工程量**：1 天 + 1 天 A/B\r\n- **依据**：sat_parameters.proto\r\n\r\n### 9. 端口连通性快速 BFS\r\nboundary_port_feasibility 是端口数检查，但没检查\"端口 ↔ 设施实际能否连通\"。在 ghost 内部跑 BFS，从每个边界端口出发，看能否到达每个 group 的需求位置。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：2-4%（ghost 形状奇怪、内部被 mandatory 切断的情形）\r\n- **工程量**：2 天\r\n- **依据**：经典 routing 可达性\r\n\r\n### 10. Power Budget 平衡 precheck\r\n现有 boundary 检查端口数，但没检查\"电力总供给 ≥ 总需求\"。简单加和检查：sum(power_pole_supply in ghost) ≥ sum(facility_demand) + routing_overhead。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：1-3%（相对小，因为 50 power poles 通常富余，但极小 ghost 会触发）\r\n- **工程量**：0.5 天\r\n- **依据**：项目自带 commodity 表\r\n\r\n### 11. Storage I/O 流量平衡\r\nstorage box 的进出口流量必须平衡（守恒律）。Ghost 边界端口 in_flow - out_flow ± storage_buffer = 0。线性等式预检查。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：2-4%\r\n- **工程量**：1-2 天\r\n- **依据**：multi-commodity flow 守恒\r\n\r\n### 12. Tree Decomposition / Component 分解\r\n对 mandatory group 之间的依赖建图，跑 tree decomposition。如果 ghost 切割导致某 component 无法整体放入，infeasible。treewidth 检查可以发现\"全局看起来 OK 但局部连通分量过大\"的情况。\r\n- **预估秒杀**：1-3%\r\n- **工程量**：5-7 天（最贵的一个）\r\n- **依据**：Samer-Szeider 2010；Wikipedia tree decomposition\r\n\r\n## Precheck 价格 / 预算建议\r\n工业实践：每个候选 precheck 预算 **0.5-2s**（ghost 数量级 1k-10k 时）。如果某个 precheck 单次 >5s，要么并行化，要么挪到 outer loop 之前的\"批次预处理\"阶段。\r\n- 廉价档（<100ms）：DFF、面积、power budget、storage 平衡 — 全都跑\r\n- 中价档（100ms-1s）：energetic reasoning、conservative scales、conflict clique — 有选择跑\r\n- 高价档（1-5s）：MCF LP、tree decomposition — 只在前面没秒杀的候选上跑\r\n\r\n## 推荐立刻加的 3 个\r\n\r\n| 优先级 | precheck | 理由 | 工程量 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| **P0** | **DFF + 面积下界**（#1） | 工程量小，论文成熟，能秒 5-10%，几乎零误判风险 | 1-2 天 |\r\n| **P1** | **CP-SAT presolve 参数批量开**（#8） | 改 5 行代码 + A/B 测，等于免费多秒 3-8% | 2 天 |\r\n| **P2** | **Energetic Reasoning 一维投影**（#3） | 对窄 ghost 收割明显，与现有 same_x_strip_capacity 互补 | 2-4 天 |\r\n\r\n预期**累计秒杀提升 11-25%**，对应 168h 全量 run 节省约 18-42h CP-SAT 时间。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Sources\r\n- [CP-SAT Primer Advanced Modeling](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/04B_advanced_modelling.html)\r\n- [CP-SAT sat_parameters.proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\r\n- [Towards Bound Consistency for No-Overlap (MDDs, 2026)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.14784)\r\n- [Conservative Scales in Packing Problems (Belov et al. 2013)](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00291-011-0277-9)\r\n- [New reduction procedures and lower bounds 2D BPP (Carlier-Clautiaux-Moukrim)](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0305054805002765)\r\n- [Exact method for 2D orthogonal packing (Clautiaux et al.)](https://www.math.u-bordeaux.fr/~fclautia/publications/clautiaux_et_al_revised.pdf)\r\n- [Energetic Reasoning Checker Revisited (arXiv 1310.5564)](https://arxiv.org/abs/1310.5564)\r\n- [More powerful energetic reasoning for cumulative](https://hal.science/hal-03595219/document)\r\n- [New data-dependent dual-feasible functions](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00207540802426656)\r\n- [Bin packing with conflicts reduction (Zahrouni-Kamoun 2025)](https://doi.org/10.1177/18724981241307388)\r\n- [Klee's Measure Made Easy (Chan 2013)](https://tmc.web.engr.illinois.edu/easyklee8_13.pdf)\r\n- [Korf 2002 New Algorithm for Optimal Bin Packing](https://cdn.aaai.org/AAAI/2002/AAAI02-110.pdf)\r\n- [FloorSet VLSI Floorplanning Dataset (2024)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05480)\r\n- [Constraint Satisfaction with Bounded Treewidth (Samer-Szeider)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f66d265a-6c96-4e9b-abca-8995d539f435","timestamp":"2026-05-08T00:42:59.779Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5bf5c337-00f3-4101-b155-87c4ce766144","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
